# Files excluded from the Docker build context. The runtime stage only
# copies scripts/ and config/; the builder stage needs Go sources, go.mod,
# and external/ (nsjail submodule). Everything else is unnecessary weight
# and churn (any change re-runs the builder stage's COPY layer).
